{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>You offer</b> — that you offer. And why do you say: 'In what have we despised [it]?' This is the despising, and you have done it because My altar is despised in your eyes — and it is the table. And in Ezekiel it is written of the altar: 'This is the table that is before YHWH.'"], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:06.312945809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}